      "result_tail": "upe:** the old `firstSeen` marked an id as seen before `Save` ran, so a failed save would have been dropped on redelivery. I replaced it in `dedupe.go` with `has` and `mark`. `Handle` now marks the id only after `Save` succeeds, so a heartbeat that fails all 3 attempts is saved on a later delivery of the same id. One saved after a retry is deduplicated as normal.\n- **Tests:** I added two to `heartbeat_test.go`. One covers success on the third attempt, followed by dedupe of a redelivery. The other covers giving up after 3 failures with `errors.Is` matching, then a successful save on redelivery."
